#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:33
#: dfe3fde4927643e289178dfe66943dd9
msgid "Video: Load an already saved Multi-waypoint Mission"
msgstr "视频：加载已保存的多航点任务"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:39
#: 00e2a1d6a87444b298f33f0dada2141e
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:41
#: 7f8c5360d0914a09af7f8d7800033120
msgid ""
"In the screenshot below, a Copter mission starts with an auto takeoff to 20 "
"meters altitude; then goes to WP 2 rising to 100 meters altitude on the way,"
" then waits 10 seconds; then the craft will proceed to WP 3 (descending to "
"50 meters altitude on the way), then returns to launch. After reaching the "
"launch position, the craft will land. The mission assumes that the launch "
"position is set at the home position."
msgstr ""
"在下方截图中，一个 Copter 任务从自动起飞到 20 米高度开始；然后前往航点 2，途中爬升到 100 米高度，然后等待 10 "
"秒；之后飞行器将前往航点 3（途中下降到 50 米高度），然后返回起飞点。到达起飞位置后，飞行器将降落。任务假设起飞位置设置在 Home 位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:52
#: b8e17d8f615a4276aeda2f41a8b45147
msgid "Copter: Mission Planning Example"
msgstr "Copter：任务规划示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:54
#: 436292b7bb9e4fca94bd8382d2a95e04
msgid ""
"You can enter waypoints and other commands (see the :ref:`Mission commands "
"<common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events_mission_commands>` "
"section below for more information). In the dropdown menus on each row, "
"select the command you want. The column heading will change to show you what"
" data that command requires. Lat and Lon can be entered by clicking on the "
"map. Altitude is relative to your launch altitude/home position, so if you "
"set 100m, for example, it will fly 100m above you."
msgstr ""
"您可以输入航点和其他命令（详见下面的 :ref:`任务命令 <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-"
"events_mission_commands>` "
"部分）。在每行的下拉菜单中，选择您想要的命令。列标题将变化以显示该命令所需的数据。纬度和经度可通过点击地图输入。高度相对于起飞高度/Home "
"位置，因此如果您设置 100m，例如，它将在您上方 100m 处飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:63
#: ad7e32101c4041dbb1f6b71ca53f56b2
msgid ""
"**Default Alt** is the default altitude when entering new waypoints. See "
":ref:`common-understanding-altitude` for altitude definitions."
msgstr ""
"**Default Alt** 是输入新航点时的默认高度。高度定义请参阅 :ref:`common-understanding-altitude`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:65
#: 840536c78db449f8918cf37bc6414223
msgid ""
"**Verify height** means that the Mission Planner will use Google Earth "
"topology data to adjust your desired altitude at each waypoint to reflect "
"the height of the ground beneath. So if your waypoint is on a hill, if this "
"option is selected the *Mission Planner* will increase your ALT setting by "
"the height of the hill. This is a good way to make sure you don't crash into"
" mountains!"
msgstr ""
"**Verify height** 意味着 Mission Planner 将使用 Google Earth "
"地形数据调整每个航点的期望高度以反映下方地面的高度。因此，如果您的航点在山丘上，如果选择了此选项，*Mission Planner* "
"将按照山丘的高度增加您的 ALT 设置。这是确保不会撞山的好方法！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:72
#: 0107aad5fad54ee68bc7033c250d8804
msgid ""
"Once you are done with your mission, select **Write** and it will be sent to"
" APM and saved in EEPROM. You can confirm that it's as you wanted by "
"selecting **Read**."
msgstr ""
"完成任务后，选择 **Write**，它将被发送到 APM 并保存在 EEPROM 中。您可以通过选择 **Read** 确认是否符合您的需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:76
#: 53ca9af0127b46c49dd20790fe9fb697
msgid ""
"You can save multiple mission files to your local hard drive by selecting "
"**Save WP File** or read in files with **Load WP File** in the right-click "
"menu:"
msgstr ""
"您可以通过选择 **Save WP File** 将多个任务文件保存到本地硬盘，或通过右键菜单中的 **Load WP File** 读取文件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:84
#: f0393a4b6278495b94886472038e525e
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "提示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:86
#: 8dac330abd7646fda9b8c6565a561195
msgid ""
"Prefetch: You can cache map data so you don't need Internet access at the "
"field. Click the **Prefetch** button, and hold down **Alt** to draw a box to"
" download the selected imagery of a location."
msgstr ""
"预取：您可以缓存地图数据，这样在野外不需要互联网访问。点击 **Prefetch** 按钮，按住 **Alt** 键绘制一个框来下载所选位置的图像。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:89
#: c31bd2632f49491297cfb0a53a85fa41
msgid ""
"Grid: This allows you to draw a polygon (right click) and automatically "
"create waypoints over the selected area. Note that it does not do \"island "
"detection\", which means if you have a big polygon and a little one inside "
"of that, the little one will not be excluded from the big one (see `this "
"<http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Relation:multipolygon>`__ for more). "
"Also, in the case of any polygon that partialy doubles backs on itself (like"
" the letter U), the open area in the center will be included as part of the "
"flyover."
msgstr ""
"网格：这允许您绘制多边形（右键点击）并在所选区域上自动创建航点。请注意，它不执行「岛屿检测」，这意味着如果您有一个大多边形和其中的小多边形，小多边形不会从大多边形中排除（更多信息请参阅"
" `此处 "
"<http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Relation:multipolygon>`__）。此外，对于任何部分向后折叠的多边形（如字母"
" U），中间的开放区域将作为飞越区域的一部分包含在内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:98
#: 2b3385f8d55240ae9c6aacaa6604298b
msgid ""
"Setting your home location to the current location is easy, just click "
"**Home Location** above where you enter your home location, and it will set "
"your home location to the current coordinates."
msgstr ""
"将 Home 位置设置为当前位置很简单，只需点击输入 Home 位置上方的 **Home Location**，它将把 Home 位置设置为当前坐标。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:101
#: 0defbd662d7245deaf88f35adef1a96a
msgid ""
"You can measure the distance between waypoints by right-clicking at one end "
"and selecting Measure Distance. Then right-click on the other end and select"
" **Measure Distance** again. A dialog box will open with the distance "
"between the two points."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过在一端右键点击选择 Measure Distance 来测量航点之间的距离。然后在另一端右键点击再次选择 **Measure "
"Distance**。对话框将打开并显示两点之间的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:107
#: 6b7967e2df354f3c8f5de4da366bd67f
msgid "Auto grid"
msgstr "自动网格"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:109
#: fbf9c5653c3448eca818ad4f4c23bbdb
msgid ""
"You can also have the *Mission Planner* create a mission for you, which is "
"useful for function like mapping missions, where the aircraft should just go"
" back and forth in a \"lawnmower\" pattern over an area to collect "
"photographs."
msgstr ""
"您还可以让 *Mission Planner* 为您创建任务，这对于测绘任务等功能很有用，飞行器只需在某个区域以「割草机」模式来回飞行收集照片。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:114
#: e5bb563c81934409bf5f87cf4702745c
msgid ""
"To do this, in the right-click menu select Polygon and draw a box around the"
" area you want to map. Then select Auto WP, Grid. Follow the dialog box "
"process to select altitude and spacing. The *Mission Planner* will then "
"generate a mission that looks something like this:"
msgstr ""
"为此，在右键菜单中选择 Polygon 并在要测绘的区域画一个框。然后选择 Auto WP，Grid。按照对话框流程选择高度和间距。*Mission "
"Planner* 将生成一个类似如下的任务："

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:122
#: e16a1b420f1542eda08ed6b5d1289b54
msgid "Mission Planner auto-generated grid"
msgstr "Mission Planner 自动生成的网格"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:128
#: 148f6a48084c44c3a0dbdcd1b681fc76
msgid "Mission commands"
msgstr "任务命令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:130
#: 22bfe056a764486b95a2f7240212e00b
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* provides a filtered list of the commands appropriate for "
"the current vehicle type, and adds column headings for the parameters that "
"need user-supplied values. These include navigation commands to travel to "
"waypoints and loiter in the vicinity, DO commands to execute specific "
"actions (for example taking pictures), and condition commands that can "
"control when DO commands are able to run."
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner* "
"提供适合当前飞行器类型的命令过滤列表，并为需要用户提供值的参数添加列标题。这些包括前往航点和在附近盘旋的导航命令、执行特定动作（如拍照）的 DO "
"命令，以及可以控制 DO 命令何时运行的条件命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:140
#: e6c1d97bdd9448e3a1022748b5b57f8e
msgid ""
"Example: LOITER_TURNS command withheadings for number of turns, direction, "
"and location to loiteraround."
msgstr "示例：LOITER_TURNS 命令，带有圈数、方向和盘旋位置的列标题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:142
#: 8027881cb42a4401bc4a39a9fc4eb544
msgid ""
"The full set of mission commands supported by all ArduPilot platforms are "
"listed in :ref:`MAVLink Mission Command Messages (MAV_CMD) <common-mavlink-"
"mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>`. This includes the full name of each "
"command (as defined in the protocol definition), information about which "
"parameters are supported, and also the corresponding *Mission Planner* "
"column headings."
msgstr ""
"所有 ArduPilot 平台支持的完整任务命令集列于 :ref:`MAVLink 任务命令消息（MAV_CMD） <common-mavlink-"
"mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` 中。这包括每个命令的完整名称（如协议定义中所定义）、支持哪些参数的信息，以及对应的"
" *Mission Planner* 列标题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:150
#: f9195ec544d445488e53c2b9834bc217
msgid ""
"Mission Planner uses a cut-down version of the full command name. For "
"example, commands like MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT, MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE, "
"MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO are listed in MP as WAYPOINT, CONDITION_DISTANCE and "
"DO_SET_SERVO respectively."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner "
"使用完整指令名称的简化版本。例如，MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT、MAV_CMD_CONDITION_DISTANCE、MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO"
" 等指令在 Mission Planner 中分别显示为 WAYPOINT、CONDITION_DISTANCE 和 DO_SET_SERVO。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:158
#: 949a064e55604311a776afe4a366eff4
msgid "End of Mission"
msgstr "任务结束"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:160
#: 5670d76f1a1148f282f0cfa3bcf182fe
msgid ""
"When the mission list is completed, Copter will loiter at the last waypoint "
"indefinitely until a mode change or disarm (as when landing), Rover will "
"hold, but Plane will RTL unless the last mission item is unlimited loiter or"
" turns, or a landing."
msgstr ""
"当任务列表执行完毕后，Copter 将在最后一个航点无限期悬停，直到模式切换或上锁（如降落时）；Rover 将保持停止；但 Plane 将执行 "
"RTL，除非最后一个任务项是无限期盘旋、转弯或降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:163
#: d40d338265f34e62ae5c7f22285dda88
msgid "Mission Reset"
msgstr "任务重置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:165
#: 4f807658e9cb408795dc7d62b60d41c3
msgid ""
"On Copter and Rover, the mission is reset to the beginning of the mission "
"list every disarm. On Plane, it is reset similarly, except in AUTO mode "
"which does not reset on disarm and leaves the \"mission pointer\" on the "
"last mission item to be performed. For all vehicles, any landing mission "
"item, when the landing is completed, will not advance to the next mission "
"item. The :ref:`MIS_OPTIONS<MIS_OPTIONS>` parameter, bit 2, can be set to "
"continue onward in the mission list after landing."
msgstr ""
"在 Copter 和 Rover 上，每次上锁时任务都会重置到任务列表的开头。在 Plane 上，除 AUTO 模式外同样会重置，AUTO "
"模式不会在上锁时重置，而是将「任务指针」停留在最后执行的任务项上。对所有机型，任何降落任务项完成降落后，都不会自动跳到下一个任务项。:ref:`MIS_OPTIONS<MIS_OPTIONS>`"
" 参数的第 2 位可设置为在降落后继续执行任务列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:167
#: 70dd92659c914cc18d5d5038b0fef289
msgid ""
"One can set an ``RCx_OPTION`` switch function (\"24\") to reset the mission "
"item pointer to the beginning of the mission list at any time."
msgstr "可以设置 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关功能（「24」）以在任何时候将任务项指针重置到任务列表的开头。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:169
#: 44eebc05c1b147159fac59324afb9129
msgid ""
"Also, the mission can be set to reset upon any entry into AUTO mode with the"
" :ref:`MIS_RESTART<MIS_RESTART>` parameter. Default (0) is to resume the "
"mission when re-entering AUTO mode."
msgstr ""
"此外，也可通过 :ref:`MIS_RESTART<MIS_RESTART>` 参数将任务设置为在每次进入 AUTO 模式时重置。默认值（0）为重新进入"
" AUTO 模式时恢复任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:172
#: 1f9de1b044964825a66d07a912d9837c
msgid ":ref:`MIS_OPTIONS<MIS_OPTIONS>`"
msgstr ":ref:`MIS_OPTIONS<MIS_OPTIONS>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:174
#: 3dee067b467c41088705092342bdf7a0
